<p dir="auto">This PR adds a page for the <code class="notranslate">log.entryAdded</code> event, the only one event in the <code class="notranslate">log</code> module (it has no commands).</p>
<p dir="auto">Also:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Updated the <code class="notranslate">log.entryAdded</code> example in the modules landing page.</li>
<li>Added a list of the event notification fields to the overview <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/WebDriver/Reference/BiDi/Modules#events" rel="nofollow">Events</a> section.<br>
This now makes it parallel to the command message fields in the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/WebDriver/Reference/BiDi/Modules#commands" rel="nofollow">Commands</a> section.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Spec link</h3>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#module-log" rel="nofollow">https://w3c.github.io/webdriver-bidi/#module-log</a></p>
<h3 dir="auto">For editorial review</h3>
<p dir="auto">Since this is the first page of its kind (a BiDi event), I've added the <code class="notranslate">webdriver-event</code> page-type to the <code class="notranslate">front-matter-config.json</code> file.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issue</h3>
